<title>CANADA: DBRS says no rating action now on Bell.</title>
<headline>DBRS says no rating action now on Bell.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Friday it believed no rating action was warranted at this time on BCE Inc's Bell Canada telephone unit despite Bell's downward revision of its 1997 financial targets.</p>
</text>
